      "player": "Opus Brewer",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "Turn 7! I drew Primeval Herald (3/1 trample, ETB and attack trigger to fetch lands). That's actually great - 3/1 trample and it fetches me lands. But wait, do I want to give THEM land ramp? No - it puts lands onto MY battlefield.\n\
\n\
Let me plan:\n\
- Activate Presence of Gond first (tap token → make another 1/1 Elf)\n\
- Cast Primeval Herald ({3}{G}) - 4 mana from Forests + Visionary = 5G. Herald costs 4G. That leaves me 1G.\n\
- Then I can attack with: Visionary (2/2), Elf Token (1/1), Skyway Sniper (1/2). That's 4 damage if unblocked.\n\
\n\
Actually wait - if I use Visionary to tap for mana for Herald, I can't attack with it. Let me use 4 Forests instead.\n\
\n\
4 Forests for Herald ({3}{G}). Visionary stays untapped for attacking. Then I have Visionary to use if needed.\n\
\n\
Let me activate Gond first:",
