      "reasoning": "Wait - their creatures are all still sick! \"Beast Token 4/4 (sick, token), Elemental Token 2/2 (sick, token), Rampaging Baloths 6/6 (sick)\". That's odd - they should have lost summoning sickness by now since they were played on their turn 7 and it's now turn 8 (my turn). Actually wait, did they not untap? Their forests are tapped.\n\
\n\
Oh wait - it says (sick) still because it hasn't been their untap step yet. Actually no, summoning sickness means they haven't controlled them since the beginning of their most recent turn. They played them on their turn 7, so they'll lose sickness at the start of their next turn (turn 8 for them). So on MY turn 8, they're still sick.\n\
\n\
This is my window! I need to attack NOW before those creatures can block next turn!\n\
\n\
Let me plan:\n\
1. Play Forest (6 lands total)\n\
2. Activate Presence of Gond (tap an Elf to make another 1/1)\n\
