      "reasoning": "They're attacking with Rampaging Baloths (6/6 trample), Beast Token (4/4), Elemental Token (2/2), and Forest (4/3 reach haste). That's 16 damage total and I'm at 8.\n\
\n\
I can only block with p130 (the 2/3 equipped Elf token) - my other tokens are tapped from attacking!\n\
\n\
Incoming: 6+4+2+4 = 16 damage. Even if I block the best I can, I'm dead. Let me think about what to block:\n\
\n\
- Block Rampaging Baloths (6/6 trample): absorbs 3 from trample, still takes 3 trample + 4 + 2 + 4 = 13 damage. Dead.\n\
- Block Beast Token (4/4): absorbs 4 damage prevented, but takes 6 trample + 2 + 4 = 12 damage. Dead.\n\
- Block Forest (4/3 reach): absorbs 4 damage prevented, takes 6 trample + 4 + 2 = 12. Dead.\n\
- Block Elemental Token (2/2): absorbs 2, takes 6+4+4 = 14. Dead.\n\
\n\
No matter what I block, I die. 16 - max 4 absorbed = at least 12 damage with 8 life.\n\
\n\
