      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Oashra Cultivator (0/3) can't kill any attacker, so the only consideration is damage prevention. Blocking Llanowar Visionary saves 2 damage, but blocking Primeval Herald would save 3 damage. The player chose to save 1 less damage than optimal.",
      "action_taken": "Blocked Llanowar Visionary (2/2) with Oashra Cultivator (0/3), saving 2 damage",
      "better_line": "Block Primeval Herald (3/1) with Oashra Cultivator to save 3 damage instead of 2",
      "snapshot_index": 278,
    },
    {
      "decision_index": 182,
      "player": "Opus Brewer",
      "type": "blunder",
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Using Titanic Growth offensively to deal 4 extra damage (opponent goes to 8 instead of 12) while facing likely lethal on the crack-back. Opponent has Rampaging Baloths 6/6, Beast Token 4/4, and Elemental Token 2/2 all becoming untapped next turn (12 power total vs Opus Brewer's 8 life). Titanic Growth on a blocker next turn could be the difference between surviving and dying.",
      "action_taken": "Cast Titanic Growth offensively during combat to push 4 extra damage",
      "better_line": "Hold Titanic Growth for defensive combat trick next turn. The 8 damage from attackers still puts pressure on opponent (20→12), and saving the Growth for blocking could prevent lethal from opponent's massive board (Baloths + tokens = 12+ power).",
      "snapshot_index": 283,
    },
    {
      "decision_index": 183,
      "player": "Opus Brewer",
      "type": "blunder",
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Opus Brewer used Titanic Growth on an unblocked 1/1 Elf Warrior token to deal 5 damage to the opponent's face (20→15), instead of using it on Llanowar Visionary (2/2 blocked by Rampaging Baloths 6/6) to kill the extremely threatening Baloths. At 8 life with the opponent having Rampaging Baloths, Beast Token 4/4, Elemental Token 2/2, and Zendikar's Roil generating more tokens each land drop, removing Baloths is far more important than 5 face damage. Baloths will generate 4/4 tokens every turn and threatens lethal attacks very soon.",
      "action_taken": "Targeted unblocked Elf Warrior Token with Titanic Growth for 5 face damage",
      "better_line": "Target Llanowar Visionary with Titanic Growth to make it 6/6, trading with and killing Rampaging Baloths 6/6 - removing the most dangerous threat on the board",
      "snapshot_index": 284,
    },
    {
      "decision_index": 196,
      "player": "GPT53C Teach",
      "type": "blunder",
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Khalni Heart Expedition is far too slow when the game should end in 1-2 turns. The opponent is at 8 life with all creatures tapped, and the player has Rampaging Baloths + Zendikar's Roil making every land trigger devastating. KHE needs 3 land drops before it does anything, wasting 2 mana that could go toward Garruk's Gorehorn (7/3) which adds lethal pressure immediately.",
      "action_taken": "Cast Khalni Heart Expedition, a slow enchantment that won't pay off for several turns.",
      "better_line": "Play Thriving Grove first (triggering 4/4 Beast + 2/2 Elemental tokens from landfall), then cast Garruk's Gorehorn (7/3) for 5 mana. This creates 13+ additional power on board, threatening lethal next turn against an 8-life opponent with tapped creatures.",
      "snapshot_index": 302,
    }
  ],
